WEBVTT

00:06:00.876 --> 00:06:02.036
After a while,

00:06:02.036 --> 00:06:04.836
I had the opportunity
to transition my work into freelance,

00:06:04.876 --> 00:06:08.796
which gave me a lot more flexibility
about where I lived.

00:06:09.236 --> 00:06:10.716
And so I decided,

00:06:10.716 --> 00:06:13.956
you know, what if I could let
the computer decide

00:06:13.956 --> 00:06:15.836
what part of the world I lived in?

00:06:15.876 --> 00:06:18.196
And so I wrote a program that figured out

00:06:18.236 --> 00:06:20.596
every city that it was possible
for me to live in,

00:06:20.596 --> 00:06:21.756
given my budget,

00:06:21.796 --> 00:06:23.556
and then chose one at random.

00:06:23.996 --> 00:06:25.916
And I started living this way

00:06:25.916 --> 00:06:27.916
and it sent me all over the world.

00:06:28.236 --> 00:06:29.716
Taipei, Taiwan,

00:06:29.716 --> 00:06:32.196
Mumbai, India, Dubai.